Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:25.63,Default,grandma,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:26.67,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:28.72,Default,grandma,0,0,0,,Okay, travel safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.77,0:00:38.64,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey! Morning, Tani!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.14,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:41.90,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:41.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1149,1)\fs28\b1\fnArial\c&HCFDBFB&\3c&H8548D8&\shad0\pos(568,99.333)}YES,\N{\c&HBAFFDC&\3c&H3BB37E&}I'M\N{\c&HA5F8FF&\3c&H7F9948&}YAMADA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:45.36,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Did Suzuki-san tell you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.78,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, you have good instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:49.90,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Well, when you suddenly pop up \Nwith that kind of energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:54.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs14\fad(399,1)\b1\fnArial\c&HB6FEF9&\3c&H7F5907&\4c&H7F5907&\shad2\bord2\pos(341.333,184.667)}BEING MY\NPAL'S PAL MEANS\N{\c&HC797F7&}WE'RE ALL BUDS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:54.03,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It's the "If you like Suzuki, then you're \Nprobably fine with me, too" theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:58.45,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I hadn't planned on telling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:00.04,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:04.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Because I don't want to tarnish \NSuzuki-san's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:05.67,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:07.63,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:11.80,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You mean you think Suzuki's reputation \Nis so elevated that it could tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:12.80,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:16.60,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,But I guess you would, Tani! \NMan, that's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.60,0:01:19.81,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,If Suzuki says it's fine, \Nthen it's fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.81,0:01:23.02,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Besides, she said, "I'm in love with Tani-kun!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.02,0:01:25.06,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,and ran out of the classroom yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.06,0:01:25.69,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.32,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I mean, how can anyone do anything \Nbut support that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:30.19,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Satou and Watanabe and Kabacho, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:31.53,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Who's that last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:34.70,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! And Suzuki's reputation \Nor whatever isn't gonna change,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:38.16,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,but my opinion of your entertainment \Nvalue has increased, Tani!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:39.37,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Entertainment value?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:45.25,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun, you're easy to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:47.92,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What's this? Flattery will get you nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.38,0:01:49.71,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I'll give you some candy. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:50.67,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I did get something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.76,0:01:51.47,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(237,1)\fs12\bord1\shad1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HC6FEFE&\move(255.333,136.667,247.667,123,0,1697)\frz284.1}That much?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:53.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.43,0:01:56.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,that's when SudaKen hugged the heroine,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:02:00.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,whispering "I love you" in her ear. \NThe scene was so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:03.48,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(614,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs28\b1\c&HE7F3CA&\3c&H9C4C3E&\4c&H9C4C3E&\pos(340,254.667)}DON'T CARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:03.48,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What's with those expressions?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:07.06,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I really couldn't care less \Nabout fiction right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:09.65,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You have some more important \Nupdates for us, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:13.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,With my shojo-manga-turned-live-action mania,\N I do want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:15.11,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fad(232,267)\c&HC089E3&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\frz18.1\move(126.667,159.333,127,133.667,0,2696)}It's\Nprecious\Nto me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:15.49,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,That's an interesting form of mania.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:21.16,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Suzuki, you were always all SudaKen this and \NSudaKen that, giving off troublemaker vibes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:23.25,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,but the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:26.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(855,480)\fnComic Sans MS\fs28\b1\c&HB8FFFE&\3c&H35F397&\4c&H35F397&\pos(454.333,169.333)\frz295.3}GRIN
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:25.12,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.17,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:30.75,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:34.22,Default,Watanabe; Satou,0,0,0,,That was no way to interact \Nwith the guy you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:36.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I am all too aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:40.31,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You weren't playing catch in your\N conversation. You were striking him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:40.31,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs32\b1\pos(320,35)\fad(232,54)\c&H854DEC&\bord1\shad0}ALL ONE-SIDED!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs28\b1\c&HF2E9D9&\3c&H8A5D09&\shad0\bord3\pos(520,80)}EEK
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:45.14,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,How about this article as a reference?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.14,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\frz13\pos(360,100)\b1\fs12\bord1\shad0\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Conversational\NTechniques for\N Those Who \NWant to Be Loved
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.90,0:02:51.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Be a good listener. Talking nonstop \Nonly about yourself is no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:49.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\blur2\b1\fnComic Sans MS\fs24\shad0\bord3\c&H65296F&\3c&HC2E2FB&\pos(243.333,104.667)}TENSE...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:49.15,Default,text; left of heard,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fnComic Sans MS\fs24\shad0\bord3\b1\c&HBAB7F0&\3c&H591E4F&\pos(96,301)}SMILE...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:51.53,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs24\shad0\bord2\b1\c&H95FFF8&\3c&H81AD60&\pos(230,14)}BE A GOOD LISTENER {\c&H8C8D24&\3c&HAEEEA4&\bord1\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:51.53,Default,text; center,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fs16\bord3\shad0\fnArial\an4\pos(240,155)\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}( {\i1}Trying to make small talk \N\h\h\hwith relatable anecdotes{\i0} )
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:52.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ask good questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:55.78,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs24\shad0\bord2\b1\c&H92FFFA&\3c&H949C66&\pos(247.333,22)}ASK GOOD QUESTIONS {\c&HA37637&\bord1\3c&HE3EBA5&\i1}! !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:55.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ask about things the other \Nperson might want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Show that you're paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:03:03.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord2\b1\c&H97FEF9&\3c&H7649B3&}SHOW YOU'RE PAYING ATTENTION {\i1\c&H690CA6&\3c&HCA9FF6&\bord1}! ! !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:03:00.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Leaving them hanging in silence \Nmight make them uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:03.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Reply when the timing is appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:06.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm totally awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:08.92,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:09.84,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.17,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.17,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(107,103)\fnComic Sans MS\fs28\b1\c&HA9FFFF&\3c&H460564&\shad0\move(539.333,152.667,551.666,122.333)}ACK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:15.55,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Stop suddenly re-realizing and freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:18.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is crazy. I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:20.05,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,For some reason, I'm annoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:24.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But, since it's started, \Nthat means there's an end, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.31,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,All the emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:27.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:31.36,Default,Suuki,0,0,0,,I'll do it, then! \NI'll become the ultimate girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:33.53,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You don't have to pretend\N to be a {\i1}Jump{\i0} character.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:36.49,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So, what's this ultimate girlfriend gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:44.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Today... I'll say, "Let's walk home together."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.45,0:03:45.54,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,You're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.46,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:22.59,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Is it okay for us to hang out here like normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:23.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.93,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's fine. Please don't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.10,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hear that, Suzuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:30.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? That makes me feel so alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.73,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Don't mind him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.73,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Should I have said it wasn't all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I was lying! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:39.86,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, that was quite the fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:42.20,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Come on, Suzuki. Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:43.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:46.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,U-Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:50.62,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\c&HEAFFCC&\3c&H8E8238&\move(515,194,535,181)}STARE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:54.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's no good! I can feel myself \Nlosing consciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:54.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(236,102)\shad0\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\b1\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HB4BD16&\move(358,210,358,196)\frz15.75}I can't\Nlook him\Nin the eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.88,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you commence some kind of battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, Tani-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.76,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Today... should we walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:06.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnComic Sans MS\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\b1\frz349.1\pos(490.667,167.333)}AFTER SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:07.39,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\pos(558,200)\c&H85E8FD&\3c&H7E54E2&}WHOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:08.10,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\c&H85E8FD&\3c&H7E54E2&\pos(55,116)}WHOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:08.89,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\pos(558,200)\c&H85E8FD&\3c&H7E54E2&}WHOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:09.60,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\c&H85E8FD&\3c&H7E54E2&\pos(55,116)}WHOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:10.39,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\pos(558,200)\c&H85E8FD&\3c&H7E54E2&}WHOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:11.10,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\c&H85E8FD&\3c&H7E54E2&\pos(55,116)}WHOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:11.89,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\pos(558,200)\c&H85E8FD&\3c&H7E54E2&}WHOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:12.52,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\c&H85E8FD&\3c&H7E54E2&\move(55,116,604,112,266,620)\fad(1,312)}WHOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:12.64,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Walking home together from the\N classroom is really nerve-racking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.98,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We're here, too, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(236,1)\fs16\bord2\shad0\c&H7F7462&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HC6FEFE&\pos(570,204)}Up to\Nthe\Nschool\Ngate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:17.11,Default,friend; female,0,0,0,,Suzuki! Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:19.11,Default,friend; male,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:22.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, Reina! Practice hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:25.53,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,Suzuki, I see you can do the\N box step now! It's weird though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:30.29,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's unreal. No one sees Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:42.05,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs28\b1\an8\fad(977,1)\c&HFEF3D1&\3c&H505212&}SILENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:54.81,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord1\frz13.56\pos(522.667,254.667)\fs18}"Talking nonstop\Nonly about yourself\Nis no good!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:54.81,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord1\frz350\pos(126.667,268.667)\fs18}"Ask about things \Nthe other person\Nmight want to talk about!!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:54.81,Default,text; left bubble; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H94FFF9&\3c&H7D3D10&\frz351.9\pos(174,50.667)}ASK GOOD QUESTIONS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:54.81,Default,text; right bubble; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H95FFF7&\shad0\3c&H7F6E09&\frz8.329\pos(461.333,49.334)}BE A GOOD LISTENER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.97,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Now that I'm really paying attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:50.14,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I really did just make him listen \Nto whatever I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:53.18,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,And what is Tani-kun interested in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:54.81,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:03.82,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(231,231)\shad0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H86FFF7&\3c&H6463B8&\frz283.5\move(71.334,102.667,51,117)}FWIP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:08.07,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Huh? It looks like Tani-kun \Nmight want to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:10.45,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Verily, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:12.45,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\bord1\shad0\fs32\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H94FFF9&\3c&H7D3D10&\frz354.2\move(482.001,327.333,505.667,183.667,27,360)}ASK GOOD\NQUESTIONS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:12.45,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:12.45,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HFC30C8&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur1\shad0\fs28\frz334.7\pos(199.333,330)}BARGES IN!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:15.37,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.67,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.04,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:23.13,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I feel like I got something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:23.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(731,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs32\b1\shad0\bord3\c&HE9FFB5&\3c&H87420A&\an8\pos(345.333,78)}HMMM...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:29.47,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,The more I think about it, \Nthe less I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:33.39,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Is being with me right now fun for Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.73,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,And this is where we part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.48,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It feels like I wasted some potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:42.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.49,0:07:47.74,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, do you have a little more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:50.78,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:52.24,Onscreen,text; below box,0,0,0,,{\fad(107,1)\bord1\frz12.57\pos(261.334,292)\c&HA24E6C&}Leaving them hanging in\Nsilence might make them uneasy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:52.24,Default,text; box,0,0,0,,{\fad(107,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord2\b1\c&H97FEF9&\3c&H7649B3&\frz7.717\pos(108.667,184.001)}SHOW YOU'RE\NPAYING ATTENTION!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:55.25,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,This morning, Yamada-kun talked to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:58.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Did he say something he shouldn't have?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:01.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No. Actually, he was really friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:05.01,Onscreen,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(228,1)\fs28\c&HBDFFF2&\3c&H841B74&\pos(312.667,18.666)\bord2}HUH?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:03.63,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,He can be overly friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H8241E3&\3c&HBAFFEF&\frz341\move(-10,72.666,217.334,133.334,24,357)}*BOOMERANG
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:11.01,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,And, because I thought that hiding this was \Nthe best option... I was a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:14.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Should I have hidden everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.06,0:08:18.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's just, yesterday, my emotions boiled up \Nand over and I blurted everything out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:22.15,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Boiled up and over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:23.77,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, he's laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,276)\fnArial\shad0\b1\c&HADFFFD&\3c&H0E3F88&\pos(53.333,330)}WHEW
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:28.40,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, I don't mind either way. \NIt doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:33.41,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But, Suzuki-san, you said you did mind, \Nso I wasn't sure if it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ugh, seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:41.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, this side of you is so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.67,0:08:44.92,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:48.84,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,My head is so full of rules and \Nconventions meant for other people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:51.43,Onscreen,text; top,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord1\fad(775,1)\pos(319.334,21.334)}TRAITS OF LONG-\NLASTING COUPLES
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:51.43,Onscreen,text; large,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fad(776,1)\fs24\c&HAB78F0&\bord1\frz7.902\pos(171.333,106)}10 RULES
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:51.43,Onscreen,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fad(778,1)\bord1\frz351\pos(448.666,98)}5 TRAITS OF WOMEN WHO\NARE LOVED BY OTHERS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.88,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,that I can't even hold a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:54.97,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I haven't even really looked at the person \Nright in front of me, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:08:58.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That stuff doesn't bother me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:02.31,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I mean, not long ago, I might've minded, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:05.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to live proudly, \Nsaying that I like what I like!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:08.57,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's the kind of policy \NI'm living my life by right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:15.33,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(524,263)\b1\shad0\fnArial\c&HC9BBF8&\3c&H250D5A&\pos(500,35.334)}STUNNED
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:18.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry. Did I fail full force just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Oh. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:23.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, do you have time this weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:24.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:24.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\fnArial\\frz293.6\pos(172.667,134.667)\c&HB7FFFE&\3c&H85962F&}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:28.34,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,If you'd like, then maybe... \NYou mentioned it before...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:29.97,Default,Suzuki; simultaneous,0,0,0,,Grabbing hamburgers...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:29.34,Default,Tani; simultaneous,0,0,0,,The hamburgers...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:35.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's crazy! We harmonized! \NIt's like telepathy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.64,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be nice if we could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:39.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! Let's go! For sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:42.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And if we're going, let's go \Nsomewhere it's easy to hang out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.23,0:09:44.61,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'll look it up, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.61,0:09:48.36,Onscreen,text,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\frz351\pos(377.333,82)}girlfriend conversation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.61,0:09:48.36,Onscreen,text; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fnArial\frz351\pos(359.333,218.667)}conversation how to keep up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.36,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:58.12,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(647,1)\fs28\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\bord1\c&H72037A&\3c&HECB6D7&\pos(68.666,46.666)}GNNNNN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, I need a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.87,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs28\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\bord1\c&H56DEEB&\3c&H329FA3&\pos(420,130)}Crumple
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:05.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:07.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's not true, is it, Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:11.30,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,This couldn't get any worse. \NHow pathetic can I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:15.26,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's devastatingly adorable, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.72,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Please just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Nope! Can't do that! I'm never gonna forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:24.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The fact that you think about me when \NI'm not around makes me way too happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:29.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I thought that I might be the only one who's \Nall excited and spinning in circles, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.37,0:10:38.70,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.62,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:48.71,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I hadn't properly told you yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:52.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,so I wanted to put it into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:55.38,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:11:00.43,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,The thing that he wanted to \Ntell me earlier... Could this be it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.47,0:11:03.93,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(485,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs28\b1\shad0\bord2\c&HF5F1FB&\3c&H7A4CA9&\pos(252.667,46.667)}POOF
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:03.56,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Steam?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:08.77,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Suzuki is made of 60 percent water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(269,1)\b1\shad0\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\c&H792EE9&\3c&HF5F1FB&\pos(97,330)}HEART-FLUTTERING
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(269,1)\b1\shad0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H792EE9&\3c&HF5F1FB&\fs22\pos(529.667,330)}DISGORGEMENT
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.27,Default - Top,Tani,0,0,0,,Everyone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let's go watch a movie, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You've already looked them up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:18.57,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(396,1)\fnArial\fs18\shad0\pos(164.667,128)\c&HB3A23F&\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Really, truly embarrassed)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:16.86,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.86,0:11:17.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:24.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I hit that anguish too hard, \Nso my throat's all dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:25.71,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Hit the anguish too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:28.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If I sang right now, I bet I'd sound cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:31.21,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, would you like a candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:33.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:38.84,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, all kinds of things come out of \Nyour pockets, huh? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:40.47,Onscreen,text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fad(276,268)\frz346.6\pos(426,95.334)\c&H9E59D4&}A festival of\Nhandkerchiefs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.39,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Oh, no. That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:42.10,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(239,271)\fs22\bord1\c&H8FFFF9&\fnArial\shad0\b1\3c&HB78432&\pos(326,282.666)}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:44.31,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I feel like someone's talking about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:45.31,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,No one would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:46.81,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:52.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't wait for our first date!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:55.86,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,I can't imagine you and Tani-kun \Nwalking around out there together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:56.65,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:58.20,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Take pictures for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:11:59.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Candid shots of Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.16,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Hardly. Shots of the two of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:05.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? No! I couldn't!\N I'd be too embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:08.04,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Suzuki, I never know when \Nyour embarrassment will kick in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:11.59,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,But it's true that Suzuki's bad \Nat smiling for photos, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:12.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(104,478)\fs28\fnArial\shad0\b1\c&HC8FEF7&\3c&H715BD4&\frz324.5\pos(458.666,50.667)}FORCED
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:15.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,They often say that dimples \Nare pit traps for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.92,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Can you even interpret those as dimples?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:20.18,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So that's why you're always \Nmaking those silly faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.18,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,It's a big step, so you need\N to make some good memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.51,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:28.94,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:31.94,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What on earth should I wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:31.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(484,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\shad0\bord0\b1\c&HCFD59C&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(565.333,156.667)}This probably\Nisn't right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.36,0:12:35.44,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of \Nclothes Tani-kun likes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:40.32,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,so I just need something generally cute \Nthat most people would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:51.46,Onscreen,text,0,0,0,,{\bord1.25\fs26\pos(532.667,104.667)\c&H9538EE&\3c&HEDE4FE&}(MEETING AT 12)
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.70,0:12:49.66,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I was so anxious, I ended up \Narriving thirty minutes early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.46,Onscreen,text; top,0,0,0,,{\bord5\fs16\c&H9C49EE&\frz16.18\move(379.999,289.334,537,140.333,24,350)}EVERYONE LOVES\N{\c&H736A62&}BABY PANDAS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:51.46,Onscreen,text; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\move(453.333,370.667,499.667,329,0,190)}*THE RESULT OF OVERTHINKING
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:58.22,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get nervous! I'm gonna be \Ncovered in sweat before we meet up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:12:59.84,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Should I duck into a shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:03.55,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,No, I'd hate it if I relaxed too much \Nand kept Tani-kun waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:07.60,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I wonder what Tani-kun will be wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:08.73,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(106,185)\fnComic Sans MS\fs32\shad0\b1\c&HC7F0FA&\3c&H8A5EED&\pos(59.333,168.667)}FLUFFY
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:08.73,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fad(521,185)\pos(581.333,197.333)\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\shad0\b1\c&H8246EA&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Train of\Nthought\Nderailed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:08.68,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.02,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,T-Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.02,0:13:12.73,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sorry. Did I keep you waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.98,Italics - Top,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,He looks pretty much the same as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.98,Default,text; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\shad0\b1\pos(318.666,352.667)\c&H531464&\3c&HFFFFFF&}(Pretty much anything'll work)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.98,Default,text; large,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs32\shad0\b1\pos(318.666,282)\c&HB278F6&\3c&H652E7E&}SQUEEEEE!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.98,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\shad0\bord1\b1\pos(40.667,50.667)\c&H9ABC20&\3c&H7FF2FC&}Regular\NClothes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.98,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\shad0\bord1\b1\pos(592,53.333)\c&HAA7430&\3c&H7FF2FC&}School\NUniform
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:18.40,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,If you'd contacted me, I'd have hurried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:20.49,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, I didn't want to rush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:22.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Actually, you're really early, Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:25.24,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's because I wanted to get here \Nabout ten minutes early.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:28.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You're twenty minutes early.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:32.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, here it is! Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:34.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The volume of it is amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:35.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:38.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you for this meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:42.72,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Huh? Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:44.55,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(104,0)\b1\fnArial\fs32\shad0\c&HC499F7&\3c&H7F3857&\move(72,114.666,72.333,403,2531,2989)}FREEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:44.22,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,When I came here before...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.31,Flashback,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Wow, look at you digging in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.77,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:57.44,Italics,Suzuki; sfx,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.81,0:13:57.02,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,226)\b1\fnArial\fs26\shad0\c&HC39BF8&\3c&H64226B&\pos(228.667,113.333)}STARE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:58.28,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:03.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's just, I was watching you and thinking, \N"Tani-kun is eating that really well."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.74,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm not a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:07.08,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, aren't you going to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm eating! I'm eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:10.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(235,225)\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\shad0\b1\pos(166.667,234)\c&HDAB3F8&\3c&H8755BE&}NIBBLE
