Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.55,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You eat one filling at a time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:22.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's too embarrassing to open \Nmy mouth wide to take a bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:25.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Maybe it's one of those \Nunfeminine things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:27.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:29.93,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,whatever's most delicious is best, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:32.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You're not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:35.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'll just go ahead and dig in, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:38.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mmm, yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We've got time before the movie, \Nso should we wander around?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:49.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, is there anything you want to buy, \Nor any shops you want to go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:49.95,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:52.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then can we just look around wherever?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:53.08,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:04.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, it's already time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:09.35,Italics - Top,announcement,0,0,0,,Recording video and audio \Ninside the theater is a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:07.47,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&HC7B2F8&\3c&H8F23BD&\blur1\b1\move(176,289,176,219)}EXCITED
