Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:12.22,Italics - Top,announcement,0,0,0,,By law, a minimum of ten years...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:18.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(484,151)\fnComic SansMS\fs32\shad3\bord3\c&HE1E9D8&\3c&H664A45&\4c&H664A45&\frz60.14\pos(585.334,170.667)}STARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:22.48,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sorry. What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:24.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:06.78,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\3c&H4B494E&\shad0\b1\bord1\move(321,202,321,146,1,2525)}THE END
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:09.11,Italics,yeti,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:14.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It was the kind of movie with \Na bonus after the credit roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:16.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I cried a little in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:16.96,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,A little?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:20.63,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry! I've gotta go cut some hedges.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:22.67,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,181)\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\shad0\bord1\pos(291,267)\c&H9523CD&\3c&HFFFFFF&}*She's\N"picking\Nflowers"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:25.30,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(319,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs22\shad0\bord1\c&HDCB41E&\3c&HF5FFDF&\pos(274,301.333)}Weepy Eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.30,Italics - Top,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:29.80,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry! If I'm in here too long, \Nit could invite another misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:32.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry, Tani-kun! Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:35.06,Default,text; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fad(233,1)\fs16\shad0\bord1\b1\c&HA5D3FC&\3c&H988DE4&\pos(352,325.333)}THE NORTH WITCH\NAND THE YETI
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:35.06,Default,text; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(108,1)\fnArial\fs32\shad0\b1\c&HAD70F4&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(286,38.667)}BOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:37.06,Flashback,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Take pictures for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:42.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Could you take a picture for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:44.57,Default,woman,0,0,0,,Okay, taking it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:48.19,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:51.57,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I could never endure the time between \Nasking someone and the shutter click!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.57,0:16:52.49,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:52.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs28\b1\c&HC894F8&\3c&H6D0065&\4c&H6D0065&\pos(540.667,199.333)}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:54.70,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Want to check that shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:55.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:59.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! It's the fluffball that was in the movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:00.33,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,The yeti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:03.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,They have the witch and the bears, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:04.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:06.84,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,So, tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:09.84,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,How would does buying \Nsomething to remember today
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:13.80,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,rate in terms of femininty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:17.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Seven hundred million points!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:19.60,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(646,1)\fs32\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord3\shad3\c&H84E8FA&\3c&H323F62&\4c&H323F62&\an8}700,000,000 POINTS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.02,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,How do those points work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:24.36,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5FAF4&\3c&HAE6147&\shad0\b1\fs16\pos(68,112)\frz50}The North Witch\Nand the Yeti
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:24.36,Default,text; right,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5FAF4&\3c&HAE6147&\shad0\b1\fs16\frz316.8\pos(553.334,96.667)}The North Witch\Nand the Yeti
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:23.52,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It's totally possible to make memories \Neven without a photo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:29.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That... town? The place where the main \Ncharacter grew up was so pretty, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:30.90,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Halcyon Town?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:31.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:35.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And the images of North \Nwhatever were pretty, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:36.87,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,North Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:39.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The cutest one was the little fluffball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.75,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,The yeti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.75,0:17:44.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But that scene where the whole \Nfamily gathered was so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I forgot their names, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:48.76,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Gotek, Nitt, Boa, Goden, Heetek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:52.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Tani-kun, you remember a ton! \NThat's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:55.60,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, did you really watch the movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.18,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's so mean! I totally watched it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:01.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm just not good at remembering \Nnames and details!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:04.56,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It really moved me! I felt it in my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:07.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And I cried during every scene with a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:08.40,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You did cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:09.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.65,0:18:13.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That part where the witch left the house and \Ncast magic on the... yeti without looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:15.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Just "whoosh," I loved that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:20.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And even though she only drinks black \Ncoffee, she put milk and sugar in it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:22.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,and she made that beautiful omurice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:25.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,She's just a major tsundere, right? \NIt was so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:26.92,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:31.34,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes, really. It was onscreen off to\N the side, but just for a split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And they only showed it \Nfor a second at the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but the number of dishes on that table!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.56,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There were enough for all of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:41.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,so I thought, "Oh, they'll all \Nbe together forever."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:42.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:44.81,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(226,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\fs28\b1\bord1\c&H93720B&\3c&HE2FF7E&\pos(129.333,200)}SORTING\NMEMORIES
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:49.15,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I see. So that's what all that meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.15,0:18:51.32,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I see. That's what...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:53.57,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It was a good movie, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:54.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You realize that now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Did you really watch the movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:58.53,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(191,187)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&HC78EF1&\b1\bord1\3c&HD4FCFE&\move(509,209,524.333,219)}HEH
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:02.29,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:09.54,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I guess the movie didn't really \Nstrike a chord for Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:15.34,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Somehow, it feels like it went by in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:19.22,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I was nervous, but it was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:20.93,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I ate what I wanted to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:24.85,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,went to the shops I wanted to, \Nsaw a movie I wanted to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:29.86,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(406,148)\bord1\shad0\b1\c&HA195F2&}HUH...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.94,0:19:27.85,Italics - Top,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:29.86,Italics - Top,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Was it all geared toward me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:37.41,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,And we've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.32,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Today is ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:43.62,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if the way home \Nstretched out longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:16.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, today...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:23.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,was a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:25.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:29.17,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs28\3c&H8E46EC&\4c&H8E46EC&\blur2\b1\pos(434,40)}PSHHHHH...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:28.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I might have dragged you around a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:31.79,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.17,0:20:36.55,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Today, the shops we went to, \Nthe movie we watched...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:40.30,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,They were all things I wouldn't \Nhave picked for myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:42.89,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,but I really had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:48.31,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Even if I went to the same places \Nwe did today and did the same things...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:52.56,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm certain I wouldn't have enjoyed\N it like I did today without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:54.69,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,So, um, basically...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:59.03,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It was fun because I was with you, \NSuzuki-san. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:04.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:08.20,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to take a picture together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:11.29,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh? Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:13.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Anywhere is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:17.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,When I look back at it, I want to \Nremember that this day was our first date,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:21.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,that we had a lot of fun, \Nthat my heart was racing... stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Like a keepsake. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:25.35,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Then, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.52,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,T-Tani-kun, you stand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:34.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, move your face a little more this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:38.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:44.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Bye, Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.37,0:21:45.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,See you at school!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:50.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(985,1)\fnComic Sans MS\bord0\shad0\c&HDB9CF8&\pos(337.334,78.666)}STARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:53.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Pandas are cute, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:55.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? You like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:57.21,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah. I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:22:00.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs32\b1\shad0\bord3\c&H8BFFFE&\3c&H9815BB&\pos(549.333,155.333)}LIKE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.92,Default,text; small,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\pos(544.667,184.667)}*Pandas
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:04.34,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,That makes me so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.68,0:22:07.89,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What is this? I mean, of course \NI feel this way about Tani-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.89,0:22:11.77,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,but I feel like I might start liking \Nmyself more with this sparkly feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.77,0:22:15.27,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right now... I feel like \NI might be the ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:17.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:18.36,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:20.28,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Dinner isn't ready yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:22.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.57,0:22:27.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm gonna look back at that photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:30.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:37.04,Default,text; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(570,1)\b1\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\pos(51.333,62)\c&HF8E5C8&\3c&HA36C1C&}GLOOM...
